{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">ERKLÄRENDE BICHELCHEN</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">ZU</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">dem Delmas senge Hëllefstabellen</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">ÉISCHT SERIE</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TABELL Nr. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">D’Schoul. — De Lycée. — D’Klass.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Allgemeng Beschreiwung.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Dës Tabell weist eng <b>Klass</b> an engem <b>Lycée</b>. An dëser Klass sinn aacht <b>Dëscher</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"Dëscher\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> an aacht <b>Bänk</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"Bänk\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Op all Bänk sëtzen dräi Schüler. De <b>Léierer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"Léierer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> sëtzt op engem <b>Stull</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"Stull\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> op senger <b>Kathedra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"Kathedra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Lénks vun der Kathedra steet e <b>Glasschaf</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"Glasschaf\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. Riets ass déi <b>schwaarz Tafel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"schwaarz Tafel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> mat hirem <b>Läppchen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"Läppchen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> an hirer <b>Kräid</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"Kräid\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Iwwer der Kathedra hänken <b>Wandtabellen</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"Wandtabellen\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"Wandtabellen\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"Wandtabellen\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> an eng <b>Kaart</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"Kaart\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Net all Schüler sëtzen op hirer <b>Plaz</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"Plaz\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. De Jang <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> steet un der Tafel; hien hält <b>dat</b> Läppchen a wëscht déi <b>geometresch Figuren</b> ewech.","t01-03-2":"De Péiter ass bei der Kathedra; hie sammelt d’<b>schrëftlech Aufgaben</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"schrëftlech Aufgaben\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> a bréngt se dem Léierer.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>Dëse</b> Léierer ass de Léierer fir <b>lieweg Sproochen.</b> Hie léiert d’Schüler friem Sproochen schwätzen, liesen a schreiwen <b>(däitsch, englesch, spuenesch, italienesch, russesch</b> oder <b>franséisch)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — D’Klass ass ganz grouss a ganz hell. Hannen ass e breede <b>Fënster</b> mat zwee <b>Fënsterlueden</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"Fënsterlueden\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> an eng <b>Glasdier,</b> fir se ze lëften an ze beliichten.","t01-05-2":"An dëser Klass ass et net kal. An der Mëtt steet, fir se ze hëtzen, en immens gudden <b>Uewen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"Uewen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> mat sengem <b>Rouer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"Rouer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Un der Mauer sinn <b>Kleederhaken</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"Kleederhaken\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> befestegt; drun hänken d’Kappen an d’Mäntel vun de Schoulkanner.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">De Schoulhaff.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — D’<b>Auer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"Auer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> weist néng Auer a fënnef Minutten.","t01-06-2":"D’<b>Paus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"Paus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> ass grad eriwwer an d’Cours fänkt nees un. D’Paus ass am <b>Haff</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"Haff\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Mir gesinn e puer Schüler, déi spillen. En <b>Iwwerwaacher</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Iwwerwaacher\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> passt op si op.","t01-07-1":"7. — Am Haff gesi mer nach verschidde Leit, nämlech den <b>Inspekter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"Inspekter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, de Schoulleeder (<b>den Direkter</b>) <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> an den <b>Zensor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"Zensor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Den Inspekter kontrolléiert d’Schoulen, den Direkter leet de Lycée, den Zensor iwwerwaacht d’Studien.","t01-07-3":"Déi véiert Persoun ass de <b>Portier</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"Portier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Hien dréit ënnert dem Aarm e Register, fir déi Feelend anzeschreiwen.","t01-08-1":"8. — Hannen am Haff sinn d’<b>Turngeräter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"Turngeräter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> an d’Atelier fir d’<b>Handaarbechten</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"Handaarbechten\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Riets vun der Tabell gesi mer d’<b>Säll</b> fir <b>Musek</b> a <b>Zeechnen</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Detailléiert Beschreiwung.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Déi gutt Schüler.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — D’Schüler an der éischter Bänk riets vun der Kathedra sinn den <b>Henri</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"lb-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, de <b>Stiffen</b> an de <b>Charel.</b>","t01-09-2":"Den Henri ass ganz opmierksam a fläisseg; hien nolauschtert dem Léierer. Op sengem Dësch huet hien e <b>Cahier</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"Cahier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, e <b>Buch</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"Buch\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, e <b>Wierderbuch</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"Wierderbuch\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> an e <b>Federmäppchen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"Federmäppchen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Säi Buch huet vill <b>Säiten</b>; all Kapitel enthält e puer <b>Paragraphen</b> an all <b>Zeil</b> vill <b>Wierder.</b>","t01-09-4":"Säin Noper de Stiffen <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> ass äifreg. Hie schreift a säi Cahier d’Aufgab fir déi nächste Kéier. Hien huet eng schéin <b>Schrëft.</b> Säi Buch ass zou. Mir gesinn nëmmen den <b>Deckel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"Deckel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Nieft him läit säi <b>Zirkel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"Zirkel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"De Charel <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> hält säi Buch an der Hand; hie mécht et op, fir seng Aufgab nach eng Kéier ze liesen. Hien huet, wéi all Schüler, en <b>Tëntefaass</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"Tëntefaass\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> virun sech. Hien ass brav.","t01-10-1":"10. — Um Dësch niewendrun sëtzen de <b>Ludwig, den Anton</b> an de <b>Paul.</b> De Ludwig seet seng <b>Lektioun</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"Lektioun\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> op an äntwert op d’<b>Froen</b> vum Léierer. Den Anton <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> ass ganz onopmierksam; heiansdo bestrooft de Léierer hien esouguer. De Paul <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> ass e gudde <b>Kamerad,</b> frëndlech an hëllefsbereet. Hien ass ganz opmierksam.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Déi schlecht Schüler.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Hannert dem Henri sëtzt de <b>Jorsch</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Jorsch\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Hien ass kee schlechte Bouf, mä hien ass <b>schwätzeg,</b> onopmierksam an onroueg. Seng <b>Liichtfäerdegkeet</b> a seng <b>Ongehorsamkeet</b> maachen <b>Duercherneen</b> während der Cours, an dacks verdéngt hien eng streng <b>Ermahnung.</b> Säi <b>Brouillon</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"Brouillon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> ass dreckeg; hien <b>mécht Tëntefleken</b> drop mat senger <b>Fieder</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"Fieder\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, an dofir benotzt hien ëmmer säi <b>Gummi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"Gummi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; seng <b>Schoultäsch</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"Schoultäsch\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> ass zerrass, well hien ass ganz noléisseg. Firwat dréit hie säi <b>Bläistëfthalter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"Bläistëfthalter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> an d’Klass vun de <b>liewege</b> Sproochen?","t01-11-2":"Säin Noper den Edmond <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> huet hien net gär. Hien ass zwar e bësse lues, mä hien ass roueg a rouheg. Hie schwätzt net; amplaz nozelauschteren, liest hie léiwer d’<b>Geschichten</b> a sengem <b>Liesbuch.</b>","t01-11-3":"Den drëtte Schüler an dëser Bänk ass de <b>Ludwig</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludwig\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Hien ass fläisseg. Hie schreift op e wäisst <b>Blat Pabeier.</b> Virun sech huet hie säi <b>Läschpabeier</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"Läschpabeier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button> geluecht.","t01-12-1":"12. — D’Schüler an der zweeter Bänk, lénks vum Léierer, si ganz jonk. Den éischten, de klengen <b>Emil,</b> kann nach net ganz gutt schreiwen; hien dréit seng <b>Schifertafel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"Schifertafel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, säi <b>Schifergrëffel</b> a säi <b>Schwämmchen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"Schwämmchen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button> mat.","t01-12-2":"Nieft him sinn den <b>August</b> an de <b>Bernard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Dee leschte schafft gutt, mä säin <b>Undoen</b> ass ganz vernoléissegt.","t01-13-1":"13. — Hannert hinne sëtzen dräi <b>Faulenzer. Den Albert</b> léiert seng Lektiounen net. De <b>Jhemp</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jhemp\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> schléift amplaz nozelauschteren. Seng <b>Faulheet</b> bréngt him <b>Virwërf</b> an esouguer <b>Strofen</b> an. Endlech ass de <b>Chrëschten</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Chrëschten\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> ze liichtsanneg. Hie <b>behëlt</b> sech schlecht a bemitt sech guer net, sech ze besseren.","t01-14-1":"14. — Seng Noperen dogéint behuelen sech gutt. Den <b>Ernest</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernest\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> huet d’Uerdnung an d’Reegelméissegkeet gär; hie benotzt ëmmer säi <b>Lineal</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"Lineal\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> a säi <b>Bläistëft</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"Bläistëft\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Hien ass en <b>externe Schüler.</b>","t01-14-2":"De <b>Frantz</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Frantz\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> ass en <b>interne Schüler</b>; hien dréit eng Uniform, ësst a schléift am Lycée. Hien ass e gudde <b>Kamerad.</b>","t01-14-3":"De Moritz spëtzt säi <b>Bläistëft</b> mat sengem <b>Messer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"Messer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; hien ass ganz suergfälteg.","t01-14-4":"Hien dréit all seng Bicher mat, seng <b>Grammaire</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"Grammaire\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, säi <b>Notizbuch</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"Notizbuch\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> an esouguer seng <b>Schreifënnerlag</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"Schreifënnerlag\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Säi <b>Schoulsak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"Schoulsak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> läit um Buedem hannert him.","t01-14-5":"Déi zwee Dëscher hannen an der Klass si vun de <b>gudde Schüler</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"gudde Schüler\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button> besat.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Zeechnen a Musek.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — An der <b>Zeechesall</b> hänken zierlech <b>Modeller</b> un der Mauer, an eng <b>Lamp</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"Lamp\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> mat engem <b>Schirm</b> hänkt vun der Plafong erof. De <b>Léierer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"Léierer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> ass ganz gedëlleg; hie verbessert d’<b>Zeechnungen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"Zeechnungen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> vun de Schüler a léiert si eng <b>Bust</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"Bust\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> no der Natur zeechnen.","t01-16-1":"16. — De <b>Museksall</b> schéngt ganz interessant. Do léiert een d’<b>Musek</b> liesen, d’<b>Tounleedernoten</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"Tounleedernoten\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> solfegéieren, déi op den <b>Notelinnen</b> geschriwwe sinn (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), d’<b>Schlësselen</b> kennen a charmant <b>Melodien</b> sangen. D’Museksstécker gi op de <b>Pult</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"Pult\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> geluecht. Ee vun de Schüler <b>spillt Piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"spillt Piano\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> an de <b>Museksléierer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"Museksléierer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>gëtt den Takt</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"gëtt den Takt\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Mir gesinn en Eck vum Atelier fir d’<b>Handaarbechten</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"Handaarbechten\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, wou d’Jongen dierfen léieren, d’Holz ze hiwwelen an d’Eisen ze feilen. Dat gëtt et net an all Lycée.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">De Sall fir d’Naturwëssenschaften.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — De Mathematiksléierer léiert d’<b>Schüler</b> <b>Geometrie, Rechnen, Kalkül</b> an d’<b>metrescht System</b>. Op der Tafel gesi mer déi wichtegst geometresch Figuren: de <b>Krees</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Krees\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, de <b>Quadrat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Quadrat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, den <b>Dräieck</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Dräieck\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, d’<b>Linn</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Linn\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Mir gesinn och eng <b>Rechenoperatioun;</b> et ass keng <b>Additioun,</b> keng <b>Subtraktioun,</b> keng <b>Multiplikatioun</b>: et ass jo eng <b>Divisioun</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Divisioun\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Op der Tabell vum metresche System gesi mer: de <b>Meter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Meter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, d’<b>Wo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Wo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> a säi <b>Gewiicht,</b> de <b>Liter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Liter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, den <b>Dekaliter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Dekaliter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, den <b>Deziliter</b> an de <b>Kubikmeter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Kubikmeter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"D’Schüler studéieren och <b>Naturwëssenschaft</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"Wandtabellen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, Zoologie <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Zoologie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, Botanik <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Botanik\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, Geologie <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Geologie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> an <b>Geschicht</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"Wandtabellen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Am Schaf sinn d’Apparater fir <b>Physik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"Glasschaf\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> a fir <b>Chimie</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"Chimie\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Um Schaf sinn: eng <b>Kugel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"Kugel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, e <b>Kegel</b> an eng <b>Äerdkugel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"Äerdkugel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Iwwer den Tabellen hänkt eng <b>Kaart,</b> déi déi fënnef Deeler vun der Welt duerstellt: <b>Europa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asien</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Asien\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Afrika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Amerika</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> an <b>Ozeanien</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Ozeanien\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, an déi zwee grouss Ozeanen, de <b>Pazifik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pazifik\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> an den <b>Atlantik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantik\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Fir d’<i>Virnimm</i> gëtt et och recommandéiert, si no der laténgescher Form ze transkribéieren. Dat ass dee eenzege Wee, fir onzieleg Ofwäichungen ze vermeiden. Wéi soll een iwwregens tëschent <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan</i> asw. wielen? Solle mir e spezielle Wierderbuch fir d’Virnimm maachen? Huele mer aus dem Latäin hiren Nominativ a soe mer: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Komplett Grammaire)."}}
